  SETTING                     VALUE                             DESCRIPTION
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  Solution language           go                                Preferred solution language. Unavailable preferences fall back without changing the saved value.
  Statement locale            en                                Preferred statement language (for example en or zh-CN). This does not change the pack's translations.
  Editor                      Automatic                         Editor command, such as code --wait. Empty uses VISUAL, then EDITOR, then vi. Used the next time you open a file.
  Theme                       auto                              Statement colors. Auto follows terminal theme reports; changes apply immediately.
  Statement images            auto                              How statement images are drawn. Changes apply immediately.
  Run timeout                 10s                               Positive duration, such as 10s or 2m. Applies to the next run; separate from reference-based time limits.
  Execution backend           local                             Code runs locally. Docker is not implemented.
  Go compiler                 go                                Executable name or workspace-relative path. Used by the next build; hc does not install Go.
▌ Go debugger                 dlv                               Delve executable name or workspace-relative path. Used by the next debugging session.
  Python interpreter          Managed (.hc/venv)                Empty keeps hc's managed .hc/venv. A command or path selects an external Python and bypasses management. Editing ne…
  Coding agent                claude                            Preset for the next generation or repair. A nonempty agent.command overrides this preset.
  Custom agent command        []                                An argv array, not a shell command. Edit hc.yaml for custom arguments; reset to [] to use the preset.
  LeetCode site               com                               Default for fetch and login. Online submissions use the currently signed-in account.




























